{"screen_name": "yamafuzi_", "file": "yamafuzi_", "name": "yamafuzi", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar/media.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F9d7fd5f9-216f-499d-a73d-3b5bc79288ad.png%3Fsensitive%3Dtrue?avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/8dd8eea1-99b8-44e4-90a2-b38337b7a588.png", "description": "", "total_works": 8, "scraped_works": 8, "first_seen": "2025-09-18T15:05:19.650319+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-16T08:24:59.426315+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 2000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-18T23:05:19.650319"}, {"amount": 2000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-19T10:54:26.678572"}, {"amount": 2000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-20T01:54:56.121898"}, {"amount": 4000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-16T08:24:59.426315+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 4000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 2000, "max": 4000}}, "links": [{"label": "Misskey_io", "url": "https://misskey.io/@saneto", "name": "saneto"}], "flags": {"from_archive": true}, "works": [{"path": "/@yamafuzi_/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c3b18eee/uploads/origins/b28a82ce-f37c-4d78-b760-0d2cf9b6629d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=721aeb3862a0cb748bb6c4ee1dbae088", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c3b18eee/uploads/origins/b28a82ce-f37c-4d78-b760-0d2cf9b6629d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=721aeb3862a0cb748bb6c4ee1dbae088, https://si.imgix.net/c3b18eee/uploads/origins/b28a82ce-f37c-4d78-b760-0d2cf9b6629d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=871d8198bdbc0c021ff62e4a8cad070b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c3b18eee/uploads/origins/b28a82ce-f37c-4d78-b760-0d2cf9b6629d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6f73cebec5d844c3c91e01007e60bfe 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのスタイルの大ファンです！\n私のOCのアートワークをお願いしたいのですが、彼は遊び好きだけど強いキャラクターです。\n参考資料を追加しましたので、ポーズの参考にしてください。\nポーズや服装、その他必要なディテールは自由に修正・選択してください。\nよろしくお願いします。\nSNSで使用させていただきます。\n参考\nhttps://imgur.com/a/reference-gJvbqYh\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/reference-gJvbqYh", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamafuzi_/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/97cf3798/uploads/origins/6b840433-61c4-41b3-ab8a-e9fc9611d850?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6713a1066e21be8c925a7eaf977e7cff", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/97cf3798/uploads/origins/6b840433-61c4-41b3-ab8a-e9fc9611d850?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6713a1066e21be8c925a7eaf977e7cff, https://si.imgix.net/97cf3798/uploads/origins/6b840433-61c4-41b3-ab8a-e9fc9611d850?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80c04c839a7c2a2cf6a2733aa60b98ed 2x, https://si.imgix.net/97cf3798/uploads/origins/6b840433-61c4-41b3-ab8a-e9fc9611d850?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dffcb9f48f9f620da696ddcc094392b7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again,\nI loved your last work for me and this time I would like my alraune OC, Serena.\nShe stands at 2 metres tall and normally has a kind and caring appearance and personality but she hides a more sadistic and mean side underneath, like a rose and its thorns. However, she is very clumsy as well due to her poor sight. Because of this, she squints a lot, which makes her look like she's glaring a lot but she's actually just trying to see what's in front of her. Her vibe is like a secret villain but isn't very good at being a villain because of her clumsiness.\nFeel free to draw her how ever you wish based on that description.\nThank you very much in advance!\n\nSerena: https://photos.app.goo.gl/pCuv9P8oWxvMjw5h6", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamafuzi_/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce082737/uploads/origins/8f85e862-cf1a-4009-961d-d40d7222491e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7f261b931dfa62689c836cdb3e8482d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ce082737/uploads/origins/8f85e862-cf1a-4009-961d-d40d7222491e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7f261b931dfa62689c836cdb3e8482d, https://si.imgix.net/ce082737/uploads/origins/8f85e862-cf1a-4009-961d-d40d7222491e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a38f7acf6029add677b5728572f5a10 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ce082737/uploads/origins/8f85e862-cf1a-4009-961d-d40d7222491e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=068818aae3ecc7fb9b5417892dcfdb26 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの絵が大好きです。\n僕のキャラクター、アシュリを描いてほしいんだ。彼女は色白の肌のオーリンの女の子で、違法レースに参加する不良です。\n\nまた、(2)の画像の服を着ているキャラクターも描いてくれると嬉しいです。\n\nポーズなどはお任せします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rdAWtAtvKq7A1-n6qd8fmNDPBBMei1_F?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamafuzi_/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/515968a6/uploads/origins/390c0b9b-0970-498c-8221-3516f59f9d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3a99ab4d9d7ccaa518e22346a27b74e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/515968a6/uploads/origins/390c0b9b-0970-498c-8221-3516f59f9d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3a99ab4d9d7ccaa518e22346a27b74e, https://si.imgix.net/515968a6/uploads/origins/390c0b9b-0970-498c-8221-3516f59f9d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d2382f62b62aba9e4fa19f66a7f882f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/515968a6/uploads/origins/390c0b9b-0970-498c-8221-3516f59f9d62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1dae0141e3f3b14ccde808b6cc158e87 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは saneto様!\n\nうちのOCマサ様はイラストをリクエストお願いします。「マサ様」は神秘的な古代の旅するキツネです。彼女はとても成熟していて賢いですが、短気で、自分のタイプの男性に恋をする傾向があります。\n\nマサ様は248㎝で、先が白い９本の尻尾を持っています。彼女は胸も豊かで曲線的な体型をしている。バストアップやヒップアップはご自由にどうぞ！\n\nありがとうございます～！\n\nマサ: https://imgur.com/a/masa-MBXe0Fi", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamafuzi_/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8d81b266/uploads/origins/5d07ef76-3593-499d-ac40-c559b20f9e8f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=716535f7cdaec2c625a6cfc6a3c7656a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8d81b266/uploads/origins/5d07ef76-3593-499d-ac40-c559b20f9e8f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=716535f7cdaec2c625a6cfc6a3c7656a, https://si.imgix.net/8d81b266/uploads/origins/5d07ef76-3593-499d-ac40-c559b20f9e8f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de453f4f95e4e67dc87552e6e5d900d1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8d81b266/uploads/origins/5d07ef76-3593-499d-ac40-c559b20f9e8f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a9c5316464abf45696711aa5a9c00ce 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello there,\nI would like to request my kitsune OC, Miho, in your style.\nShe is a goddess of love and relationships despite her being single, which she worries about a lot. She has the vibes of an older woman who is professional at work in front of others but is a slob when in private or with people very close to her. She loves drinking wine but is also fond of coffee due to her lack of sleep from staying up watching anime or playing games.\nFeel free to draw her how ever you wish based on that description. Thank you very much in advance!\n\nMiho: https://photos.app.goo.gl/oGY5q8NHZAWvv1AUA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamafuzi_/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b3fca002/uploads/origins/e9be1eec-04d8-4748-9b0f-bee094707c39?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c1a1c28a95eee11fe6c2438e271ca4b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b3fca002/uploads/origins/e9be1eec-04d8-4748-9b0f-bee094707c39?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c1a1c28a95eee11fe6c2438e271ca4b, https://si.imgix.net/b3fca002/uploads/origins/e9be1eec-04d8-4748-9b0f-bee094707c39?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a676cf50ce26bff70a5645269e84c614 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b3fca002/uploads/origins/e9be1eec-04d8-4748-9b0f-bee094707c39?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=081ea0664521aa5cb7d7fb0142c709ec 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私はあなたのスタイルが大好きで、私のバニーガールのキャラクターをリクエストしたいと思っています！\n彼女はいつも疲れたような琥珀色の目をしているお姫様です。\n彼女はまた、鋭い歯と長い舌を持っています。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YlwqWM9raz25_uzcr9VLqZwXqoRuIGx4?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YlwqWM9raz25_uzcr9VLqZwXqoRuIGx4?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamafuzi_/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4edde592/uploads/origins/f2d925fa-75c0-4a1c-9b30-a4e24e43fe46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1f512d15272bee232408127a35a192f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4edde592/uploads/origins/f2d925fa-75c0-4a1c-9b30-a4e24e43fe46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1f512d15272bee232408127a35a192f, https://si.imgix.net/4edde592/uploads/origins/f2d925fa-75c0-4a1c-9b30-a4e24e43fe46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8443a0fb88ba83a266e0586036ed073a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4edde592/uploads/origins/f2d925fa-75c0-4a1c-9b30-a4e24e43fe46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=421131bb69ed79f7b680559939642d0b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "平素より大変お世話になっております。\nウマ娘のオルフェーヴル（勝負服姿）を描いて頂けると民草一同メチャクチャありがたいです、くれぐれも宜しくお願いします！！！\n何でもしますから！！！\n使用用途は、iPadの壁紙とかにしたいです…\n\nhttps://umamusume.jp/character/orfevre", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamafuzi_/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/90d0ce4c/uploads/origins/7d4add80-a776-453f-b085-53ce4839fd67?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1de15bb851d9f1dc72aa9382b2faa95d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/90d0ce4c/uploads/origins/7d4add80-a776-453f-b085-53ce4839fd67?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1de15bb851d9f1dc72aa9382b2faa95d, https://si.imgix.net/90d0ce4c/uploads/origins/7d4add80-a776-453f-b085-53ce4839fd67?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cca0cddeaa9e39094d334518225c8b9f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/90d0ce4c/uploads/origins/7d4add80-a776-453f-b085-53ce4839fd67?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da647985b37ff4eb1a23aee4271b0d78 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\n私の創作キャラクターを描いて頂きたくリクエスト送信させて致しました。\n\n●キャラクター\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-3O2zzTYQyS0rn1WTxK-iMLBdkyIMpw6?usp=drive_link\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1t28Kwu17eiSZvoCuaIOznCcXDfRWw023?usp=drive_link\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10EU2qnUofmAEd1qvq79Y2F0YQzbC_Ozv?usp=drive_link\n↑の中から好きなキャラを描いていただけたらと思います！\n\n・服装、構図等おまかせいたします。\n・可能な範囲で好きなお洋服を着せていただけたら嬉しいです！\n・女装、セクシーな衣装OK！\nご参考までに私の好き衣装です\nhttps://pin.it/12MS23Ued\n\n●納品形式\n可能であれば、キャラのみの透過画像が欲しいです。\nPSDファイルがあるとより嬉しいです。\n\n●使用用途\nプライベート用グッズ制作\n個人鑑賞用\n\nもしご縁がございましたら、よろしくお願い致します。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}